# pgServer naming

- User table model is `chatUsers` (Postgres table name: `chat_users`).
- Never use a Drizzle table named `users` in `pgServer`.
- Import from `models/user.js` as `chatUsers` (or from `models/index.js`).
- Message `sender` / `receiver` FKs reference `chatUsers.id`.
- Keep API endpoints the same as the Mongo `server` folder; only the DB table/model name differs.
